@startuml
title Link Studio - DFD Level 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #596B59
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4E8
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #70816C
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F3F7EE
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #70816C
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #EDF4E8
skinparam databaseBorderColor #70816C

top to bottom direction
rectangle "Member / reviewer" as U
rectangle "Link recipient / QR scanner" as V
rectangle "OpenAI Responses API\n(optional external provider)" as AI
usecase "1.0\nAuthentication\nand Profile" as P1
usecase "2.0\nCreate\nShort URL" as P2
usecase "3.0\nEdit / status\nand private Tags" as P3
usecase "4.0\nPreview\ndestination" as P4
usecase "5.0\nResolve / count\nand redirect" as P5
usecase "6.0\nGenerate /\ndownload QR" as P6
usecase "7.0\nHistory / search\nand Analytics" as P7
usecase "8.0\nExport\nowned CSV" as P8
usecase "9.0\nAI assistance" as P9
database "D1: users" as D1
database "D2: sessions" as D2
database "D3: links" as D3
database "D4: click_events" as D4
database "D5: chat_conversations" as D5
database "D6: chat_messages" as D6
database "D7: qr_codes" as D7
database "D8: csv_exports" as D8
database "D9: preview_events" as D9
U --> P1 : register/login/logout,\nname/photo/password, cookie + CSRF
D1 --> P1 : password hash / profile
P1 --> D1 : new account / updated name, normalized\nphoto, password hash
D2 --> P1 : session / absolute expiry / CSRF state
P1 --> D2 : new/rotated/revoked sessions
P1 --> U : user, cookie, CSRF token / auth error
P1 --> P2 : verified session owner + write protection
P1 --> P3 : verified session owner + write protection
P1 --> P7 : verified session owner
P1 --> P8 : verified session owner
P1 --> P9 : verified session owner + write protection
U --> P2 : HTTP/HTTPS URL, title, alias, Tags, expiry\nchoice
P2 --> D3 : validated code/destination/owner/UTC\nexpiry/private Tags
D3 --> P2 : unique code conflict / stored link
P2 --> U : Short URL / input or conflict error
U --> P3 : code + title/originalUrl/Tags OR explicit\nisActive
D3 --> P3 : owned link / existing attributes
P3 --> D3 : owner-filtered metadata or status update
P3 --> U : saved Link / validation or not-found error
V --> P4 : Preview code / refresh / status recheck
D3 --> P4 : title, stored URL, expiry, is_active no\nprivate Tags
P4 --> V : hostname/full URL/status / missing no\nclick event
V --> P5 : GET or HEAD code from Short URL, QR or\nContinue
D3 --> P5 : latest destination / availability under\nrow lock
P5 --> D4 : link_id + database time qualifying GET\nonly
P5 --> V : 302 Location after commit / 404 / 410 /\nsafe failure
U --> P6 : existing link code / download choice
V --> P6 : existing link code / download choice
D3 --> P6 : existing code
P6 --> U : PNG encoding public Short URL no click\nevent
P6 --> V : PNG encoding public Short URL no click\nevent
U --> P7 : q, single Tag, page / owned totals request
D3 --> P7 : owned history, private Tags, active/total\nlink counts
D4 --> P7 : owned event counts / UTC daily totals
P7 --> U : My links / tag choices / UTC statistics
U --> P8 : q + single Tag all matching pages
D3 --> P8 : owned matching rows / status / UTC dates
D4 --> P8 : matching link event counts
P8 --> U : UTF-8 BOM CSV / validation or >10000 error\nno click event
U --> P9 : question / recent conversation / optional\nstats consent
D3 --> P9 : own aggregate link totals only when opted\nin
D4 --> P9 : own aggregate opens only when opted in
P9 --> AI : guide + conversation + optional aggregate\nstore:false
AI --> P9 : plain-text answer / failure
P9 --> U : answer / sanitized error saved chat / no\nlink mutation or click events
P6 --> D7 : Short URL payload + PNG cache
D7 --> P6 : cached PNG for current public base URL
P4 --> D9 : successful metadata GET + status no IP
P8 --> D8 : owner + filters + filename + row count
P9 --> D6 : successful question-answer pair / delete\nowned chat
D6 --> P9 : owned stored recent messages
P9 --> D5 : new conversation / updated time / delete\nowned chat
D5 --> P9 : own recent conversations / verified\nownership
note bottom of P5
Only committed successful GET redirects count as opens.
HEAD, Preview, QR, CSV and AI do not add click events.
Missing = 404; disabled/expired = 410.
end note
note bottom of P9
Owner-scoped saved chats; aggregate sharing is opt-in.
AI offers advice; it does not mutate links.
end note
@enduml
